+"""PRIVATE lossless phase-pair storage codec; no source/clock/input authority.
+
+Version 1 of this new subformat is only for an explicitly selected Projection2.
+Historical Projection1 is not rewritten. The complete stimulus table is stored,
+not regenerated when decoding. All reconstructed packets pass the original
+PhaseFixture validator and retain their original canonical hashes and types.
