+private runtime files. No shared repository, Binding, native or public route.
+
+`ProjectedSources` initializes first-failure, full-unwind and original-call-work
+holders before delegated IO. Source.save captures the FIRST actual exception
+and traceback before its refusal callback; Source.read additionally retains the
+actual outer unwind and all read locals, without replacing the first original
+error/TB. A failed acquisition never clears these holders or becomes reusable.
+The same original work, returned_original and actual uncertain OFDs remain held.
+512 bytes of fixed custody-linkage allowance are ADDITIVE to the existing
+Source.seal_bill before first SDK. It is constant through failure, not a release
+or an assumed spare-control credit. No RSS or universal copy-bound claim.
