+`(original_work, original_work.bytes)` is strongly held before ledger.begin/SDK.
+While ledger.work IS that SAME object from that SAME synchronous read, it is
+one existing reservation, not two allocations or numerically similar callers.
+The old guard/passive/active formula remains unchanged. Once ledger completion
+clears work, FULL original call work becomes ADDITIVE to all remaining domains:
+
+    while same work token: old_max(guard, passive, work.bytes) + coordinator
+    after ledger clear: old_max(guard, passive, work.bytes) + coordinator + call.bytes
+
