+within original16MiB; no threshold is changed. The original512 parts,1MiB wire,
+Role4W,128KiB cache,5/1.5/120 timings and all source/physical guards remain.
+
+The call holder clears only after ALL old checks including final freshness and
+phase-stable refusal. There is then only return of `returned=restored`, already
+in Source.frames/logicalFrameBill, followed by the old plain-object entry-token
+finally assignment. No external callback, SDK/Source/clock/input, opaque-holder
+release or new frame copy occurs after the positive clearing. This does NOT
+decrease existing caller/passive/native reservations or claim their universal
