+## Exact ordinary action/source map
+
+1: Open via existing PicoEmoteInputs+TokenEmoteUI/OpenXR tablet.
+2..21: ten actual chooser names Crying, Surprised, Dancing, Cheering, Waving,
+Fall, Pointing, Clapping, Sit, Love. Each ordinary play has native override,
+loaded clip/advancing pose and actual final-pose measurements through existing
+PicoEmoteEffects.played and emote_rig_measurements. Nine wait-complete calls
+issue no product input; the caller observes actual natural restoration. The
+standard Sit uses ordinary Cancel and actual restoration.
+22..24 nominal: runner-owned cancel/Sit repeat block. Existing controls always
+request only Sit; existing native effect returns the actual Sit1/2/3. Each
+cancel is either actual active restoration or the defined idle reset. No
+adapter-generated unique-variant success.
+25: ordinary Waving override of actual active Sit, using replacement() and its
+real old restore/new loaded-play evidence.
+26: final ordinary Cancel, requiring actual before-nominal-end restoration.
+27: existing PicoEmoteBackground normal Home/background and ordinary app.launch
+foreground return; original PID/launch/lifecycle/native history continuity,
+actual original input/source headers and background_recompute after return.
+28: ordinary Close and actual panel absence, original controller neutral and
+PicoEmoteLifetime actual original3s quiet. Renderer/PNG/receipt owners must
+already be retired. No missing worker or root is treated as retirement.
